      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.57.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He will send from heaven, and save me,",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "When",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " he that would swallow me up reproacheth; [Selah\nGod will send forth his lovingkindness and his truth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.57.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.57.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My soul is among lions;\nI lie among them that are set on fire,\nEven the sons of men, whose teeth are spears and arrows,\nAnd their tongue a sharp sword.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.57.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.57.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Be thou exalted, O God, above the heavens;",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "Let",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " thy glory ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " above all the earth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.57.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.57.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They have prepared a net for my steps;\nMy soul is bowed down:\nThey have digged a pit before me;\nThey are fallen into the midst thereof themselves. [Selah",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.57.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.57.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My heart is fixed, O God, my heart is fixed:\nI will sing, yea, I will sing praises.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.57.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.57.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Awake up, my glory; awake, psaltery and harp:\nI myself will awake right early.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.57.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.57.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I will give thanks unto thee, O Lord, among the peoples:\nI will sing praises unto thee among the nations.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.57.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.57.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For thy lovingkindness is great unto the heavens,\nAnd thy truth unto the skies.",
